{"id":"poyavit_sya","lemma":"появиться","pos":"verb","rank":2328,"glosses":["to appear, to show up, to emerge"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/ff/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%8F%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%8F%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"появлюсь","2s":"появишься","3s":"появится","1p":"появимся","2p":"появитесь","3p":"появятся"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"появись","2p":"появитесь"}}},"past":{"m":"появился","p":"появились","f":"появилась","n":"появилось"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"появляться","examples":[{"text":"Он наконец появился.","en":"He appeared at last.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"at last, finally"},null]},{"text":"Я уверен, она скоро появится.","en":"I'm sure she will turn up soon.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"soon"},null]},{"text":"Когда появилась эта боль?","en":"When did this pain start?","words":[{"g":"when"},null,null,{"g":"pain, ache"}]},{"text":"Почему они не появились?","en":"Why didn't they show up?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Я так рад, что ты появился.","en":"I'm so glad you showed up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"glad"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}